                <l xml:id="m-50eda7fc-dde9-48eb-af7e-a84c1e2a2f82" facs="#m-7a329cfb-200e-4600-a9f5-86a360887856" label="ambiguous">804</l><l xml:id="m-7c5c8bfd-3fcd-4c39-aa94-ee5de77c86d3" facs="#m-08d88f53-f8d2-4f83-a6d4-9b28b418afa4" label="ambiguous">Saturday in Easter Week.</l><l xml:id="m-119edd1d-36a7-4df3-87c0-c87e3718edc8" facs="#m-f39efff9-9648-4b62-849d-b36e42b617f0" label="lyrics-like">et in térra, alle-lú-ia. Eu o u a e¬</l><l xml:id="m-da6ce545-0115-40e5-8fb2-7809497f6acf" facs="#m-7183bde5-e9c9-49ee-830e-8fae530b687b" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212. — Prayer. Omnípotens. D. 801.</l><l xml:id="m-d2317d58-0688-4f52-87e6-6272243a92e1" facs="#m-5517b568-14f1-4673-8351-beeca463d289" label="ambiguous">SATURDAY IN EASTER WEEK.</l><l xml:id="m-c90a6df7-48a9-4133-9132-06cb98951cd7" facs="#m-6bfa1cd4-ac82-490d-bda1-8f0df4960c82" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-e56bae88-ec47-48df-91f0-f53424debbd8" facs="#m-c34b7931-adac-4cfa-b845-74a0cd674edd" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-d19d29fa-2300-4812-973d-ef115b035bf8" facs="#m-d7082a74-9ba9-4372-a357-874ba0333901" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-5b3cf3dc-7c0f-469f-9adf-72fc120c8bb8" facs="#m-0cca7e5e-a895-4de4-810f-69bed92491be" label="lyrics-like">-dúxit Dómi-nus “pópu-lum sú- um in exsul¬</l><l xml:id="m-484165ef-6cbf-4c10-b7f6-70cca4a7ca12" facs="#m-211ff70d-c750-484c-8a70-60f58b6901f9" label="ambiguous">ta-ti-6-ne, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-6751b7f4-3258-4d7a-b690-6400122e77e1" facs="#m-8ba00604-bfe9-4bdb-951e-d38dd525cffa" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia : et e-léctos sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-ce44a25e-495d-44bc-98d4-817023726bd2" facs="#m-80338779-b80b-4734-bb68-07e36b567dc2" label="ambiguous">in</l><l xml:id="m-4f052a05-508d-4460-a57d-5b6eae210484" facs="#m-5caa5bf1-d4c5-401c-a251-abfe930810d1" label="lyrics-like">alle lú- ia, alle- lú- ia. Ps. Con¬</l><l xml:id="m-6f783782-e6d7-49e1-b354-9239e96e8f58" facs="#m-f50f3e03-f08e-44ab-8958-3f94aae038d7" label="ambiguous">lac-t- ti¬ a,</l><l xml:id="m-22412cb8-fade-442d-ab4d-e385ce9ea5df" facs="#m-e76cee48-ce41-479c-a2d0-c65613475f8b" label="lyrics-like">fi-témini Dómino,</l><l xml:id="m-ccab2fe0-3eee-4e06-885b-1862630782a4" facs="#m-c827d628-432d-4b0a-a377-55f0028e39e2" label="lyrics-like">et invocáte nómen éjus:* annun¬</l><l xml:id="m-40f3d376-5050-4da6-919a-9969540ca817" facs="#m-0d492683-d5f4-4840-b7b4-f663c22d8b3e" label="lyrics-like">ti-á-te inter géntes ó-pe-ra é- jus. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-6ecf2691-7a93-4da6-975e-634b9c6866fc" facs="#m-6ac7ca64-4753-4f4f-ba55-8ecbe752bdb7" label="ambiguous">Eu ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-52fd1cb2-03c5-460a-beae-07a0b3e8a63c" facs="#m-2ef62215-4233-4a0c-b5f8-007c6fd534ec" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-40f01327-0fb8-4c53-99b6-8bf000b1d164" facs="#m-505f49ad-2407-4925-84a4-7a3c42ab29fe" label="lyrics-like">vOncéde, quaésumus omnípotens! tingere ad gáudia aetérna mereá¬</l><l xml:id="m-b8e0063c-7bf0-4cf8-a8a2-4edaaf445bed" facs="#m-29e0acdd-2614-49d6-b520-7dda5ccbe948" label="lyrics-like">L Deus: t ut qui festa paschália mur. Per Dõminum.</l><l xml:id="m-198566cd-c328-4568-886e-cacfb3021218" facs="#m-6a849553-50b4-4ccb-b155-dbf3c3015166" label="lyrics-like">venerándo égimus, * per haec con¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf692a33-05bd-476e-ac71-d6774b15e55f" facs="#m-f7f60b77-b035-4d6f-9c86-d67eaff1c79c" label="text-like">2. for the Church or for the Pove, p. 819.</l></lg>
